    - target: {fileID: 3494286750899429094, guid: e9b2f69a0732af34d8cb836d835d002b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: NarrationEN
      value: Watch the red blood cells line up single file to squeeze through the
        capillary - it's that narrow! Right here they drop off the oxygen they've
        been carrying and pick up carbon-dioxide waste to take away. It's like a
        delivery truck making its very last stop.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3494286750899429094, guid: e9b2f69a0732af34d8cb836d835d002b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DescriptionEN
