    - target: {fileID: 5527861884819494159, guid: e4047944c1d93734ab266317427d5118, type: 3}
      propertyPath: NarrationEN
      value: 'This is the wall of a capillary - the tiniest blood vessel of all.
        It''s so thin that oxygen and food can slip right through it into your body''s
        cells, and waste can pass back in. This is the exact spot where your blood
        does its most important job: the big trade!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5527861884819494159, guid: e4047944c1d93734ab266317427d5118, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DescriptionEN
      value: The paper-thin wall where oxygen and food pass into your body.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
